        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="s1" parent="1" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#dae8fc;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;align=center;" value="1. Scope &amp; architect solution [CLI]&#xa;Model schema, pipeline design, DAX strategy.&#xa;Output: ADR / spec committed as markdown" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="70" width="260" x="430" y="130" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="s2" parent="1" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#d5e8d4;strokeColor=#82b366;align=center;" value="2. Create ADO repo; clone; init Git [SYS]&#xa;One-time. Establish dev/test/prod branch strategy" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="70" width="260" x="430" y="260" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="s3" parent="1" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#d5e8d4;strokeColor=#82b366;align=center;" value="3. Link Fabric workspace to ADO repo&#xa;(Git Integration) [SYS]&#xa;One-time per workspace" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="70" width="260" x="430" y="390" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="s4" parent="1" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#d5e8d4;strokeColor=#82b366;align=center;" value="4. Configure MCP servers in CC CLI [SYS]&#xa;ms-fabric-mcp-server + powerbi-modeling-mcp;&#xa;opt-in per session to control token cost" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="70" width="260" x="430" y="520" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="s5" parent="1" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffe6cc;strokeColor=#d79b00;align=center;" value="5. Scaffold empty Fabric artifact shells&#xa;via MCP [CLI]&#xa;create_lakehouse / pipeline / notebook /&#xa;dataflow / semantic_model. Containers only" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="80" width="260" x="430" y="650" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="s6" parent="1" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#fff2cc;strokeColor=#d6b656;align=center;strokeWidth=2;" value="6. Author TMDL, T-SQL, pipeline JSON&#xa;locally in VSC [BOTH]&#xa;EXT: inline assist on open files.&#xa;CLI: boilerplate, stored procs, DAX, JSON" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="80" width="260" x="430" y="790" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="s7" parent="1" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#fff2cc;strokeColor=#d6b656;align=center;" value="7. Execute MCP-only operations (no local&#xa;file equivalent) [CLI]&#xa;Pipeline runs, Livy/Spark statements,&#xa;refresh_semantic_model, DAX validation" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="80" width="260" x="430" y="920" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="d1" parent="1" style="rhombus;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#333333;" value="D1: More dev needed?" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="90" width="180" x="470" y="1040" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="s8" parent="1" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#e1d5e7;strokeColor=#9673a6;align=center;" value="8. Git commit and push to ADO [SYS]&#xa;TMDL, T-SQL, pipeline JSON, markdown only.&#xa;Commit: [domain]_[artifact]_[action]" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="70" width="260" x="430" y="1170" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="s9" parent="1" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#e1d5e7;strokeColor=#9673a6;align=center;" value="9. Fabric Source Control: Update&#xa;workspace from repo [SYS]&#xa;Pull latest from ADO into Dev workspace" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="70" width="260" x="430" y="1290" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="s10" parent="1" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#e1d5e7;strokeColor=#9673a6;align=center;" value="10. Validate: row counts, DAX queries,&#xa;pipeline run results [CLI]&#xa;MCP DAX queries, job status checks,&#xa;Livy row count statements" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="80" width="260" x="430" y="1410" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="d2" parent="1" style="rhombus;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#333333;" value="D2: Model / data&#xa;validation passed?" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="90" width="180" x="470" y="1530" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="s11" parent="1" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#f8cecc;strokeColor=#b85450;align=center;strokeWidth=2;" value="11. Author reports exclusively in&#xa;Fabric web UI [SYS]&#xa;Depends on a stable semantic model.&#xa;Do NOT author locally (PBID/Direct Lake friction)" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="80" width="260" x="430" y="1650" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="s12" parent="1" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#f8cecc;strokeColor=#b85450;align=center;" value="12. Fabric Source Control syncs web&#xa;reports to ADO automatically [SYS]&#xa;Report definitions committed without&#xa;manual export" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="80" width="260" x="430" y="1780" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="s13" parent="1" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#f8cecc;strokeColor=#b85450;align=center;" value="13. Pull locally for Git history only [SYS]&#xa;git pull to retain version history. NEVER&#xa;edit report files locally with Power BI Desktop" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="70" width="260" x="430" y="1910" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="s14" parent="1" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#f8cecc;strokeColor=#b85450;align=center;" value="14. Report validation [CLI]&#xa;Verify visuals, measures, filters, and&#xa;Direct Lake behaviour in the web UI" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="70" width="260" x="430" y="2030" as="geometry" />
